# ⚠️  NOT RUNNABLE — syntax reference only. Do not expect this to pass.
#
# example-shop.com is an invented address; nothing here has ever been executed
# against a real page. The file exists to show what FOR EACH, REPEAT and WHILE
# look like, and it fails on the first VERIFY.
#
# It is also slow to fail: `WHILE button 'Load More' exists` keeps matching on a
# page that has no such button, because a top-ranked candidate is not the same
# as a present one. The loop is capped at 100 iterations, so a headed run spends
# roughly three minutes before giving up.

@context: Demonstration of loops and page objects in ManulEngine (Go)
@title: loops-and-pages-demo
@var: {products} = Laptop, Headphones, Mouse

STEP 1: Navigate to the shop
    NAVIGATE to https://example-shop.com/
    VERIFY that 'Products' is present

STEP 2: Add each product to cart
    FOR EACH {product} IN {products}:
        FILL 'Search' field with '{product}'
        PRESS Enter
        CLICK the 'Add to Cart' button NEAR '{product}'
        VERIFY that 'Added to cart' is present

STEP 3: Retry checkout if needed
    REPEAT 3 TIMES:
        CLICK 'Checkout' button
        IF text 'Payment Error' is present:
            CLICK 'Retry Payment' button
            WAIT 2

STEP 4: Load all reviews
    WHILE button 'Load More' exists:
        CLICK the 'Load More' button
        WAIT 1

STEP 5: Verify order completion
    VERIFY that 'Thank you for your order!' is present

DONE.
